  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PPP Albatros/Karen Blixen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project, entitled Learning for Life, Responsible Tourism at Karen Blixen Camp, targets the education and training of the local Maasai youth. The project aims to support the Danish Prime Minister Lars L&#xf8;kke Rasmussen&#xbf;s initiative &#xbf;Realising the Potential of Africa&#xbf;s Youth&#xbf; launched through the Africa Commission. The project aims to achieve this through specific activities targeting the creation of a hospitality industry institution; the expansion and strengthening of the local educational facilities; and establishing a holistic forestry programme for the community and tourism operators.</narrative>
  </description>
